(294, 429, '\"lyrics.wikia.com\"\n\nMy feet\nkeep taking me to your street\ncause theres a chance i\'ll meet you\nthats what i wanna do\n\nI keep looking for a chance\na chance to steal a glance of you\nthats what i wanna do\n\nc\'mon please take my hand\ni need somebody to understand\nneed somebody to show\nthe way to go-go\n\ni can\'t stand up\ni can\'t get down, down\nget down, get down (go-go)\n\ni can\'t stand up\ni can\'t get down, down\nget down, get down (go-go)\n\nunless i\'m making a mistake\nwe\'ve got some loving to make ohh\nthats what i wanna do\n\nmy feet\nkeep taking me to your street\ncause theres a chance i\'ll meet you\nthats what i wanna do\n\nc\'mon please take my hand\ni need somebody to understand\nneed somebody to show\nthe way to go-go\n\ni can\'t stand up\ni can\'t get down, down\nget down, get down (go-go)\n\ni can\'t stand up\ni can\'t get down, down\nget down, get down (go-go)\n\nwhen you come around\ni fall to the floor\ni hammer on the door\na million times or more\n\nwhen you come around\n(what do you do?)\ni hammer on the door\na million times or more\n\nwhen you come around\n(what do you do?)\ni hammer on the door\na million times or more\n\ni can\'t stand up\ni can\'t get down, down\nget down, get down (go-go)\n\ni can\'t stand up\ni can\'t get down, down\nget down, get down'),
